---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../config/site.ts";
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${SITE.name} handles your information.`}>
  <section class="page-hero"><div><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated November 1, 2026</p></div></section>
  <div class="page"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
    <div class="panel prose">
      <p>{SITE.name} is a free job board that gathers public school job openings in {SITE.state}. We keep data collection to a minimum.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600">Job seekers</h2>
      <p>You do not need an account. Jobs you save are stored only in your own browser on your own device. We do not receive them. Clearing your browser data removes them.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600">Employers</h2>
      <p>If you fill in our Post a Job form, your details are saved in your browser so you do not retype them, and the form opens an email to us. We receive only what you choose to send us. If you buy a plan, payment is handled by Stripe. We never see or store your card number. Stripe shares with us your name, email, and the details you enter at checkout so we can set up your listing and send receipts.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600">Email</h2>
      <p>If you email us, we keep the conversation so we can reply and keep records. We do not sell or rent your email address.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600">Cookies and tracking</h2>
      <p>We do not run advertising or tracking cookies. Our hosting provider (Cloudflare) may process standard technical data, such as IP addresses, to deliver the site and protect it from abuse.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600">Job listings</h2>
      <p>Listings come from the employers' own public postings and link to their official applications. When you apply, you share information with that employer under its own policies.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600">Your choices</h2>
      <p>To ask what we hold about you, or to have it deleted, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>. We will respond within a reasonable time.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600">Changes</h2>
      <p>If we change this policy, we will post the new version here with a new date.</p>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</Base>
